<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hot Topic downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hot Topic downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said on Tuesday it cut its rating on the shares of Hot Topic Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Late Monday, the company reported second quarter earnings of $0.04 per share versus $0.02 per share.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
</text>
